{"title": "Random", "pageid": 2031, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><b>Random</b></i> is the son of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Chronoron\" title=\"Chronoron\">Chronoron</a></i> and younger brother to <i><a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a></i>. He was once known as a sneaky and somewhat shady character often getting on the nerves of his siblings. Random helps Pavel to regain his memory, and supports Pavel for the throne of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a></i>. After the final battle at the Courts of Tumba, the Unicorn chooses Random himself to succeed Chronoron. Random's passions before this were gliding, women, gambling and drumming.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofyander.fandom.com/wiki/Random?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231355\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 321/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.423      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.423      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofyander:pcache:idhash:2031-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501231355 and revision id 4460. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "